      "text": "Given:\n\\[ x^{2017} - 2x + 1 = 0 \\]\nSolving for \\(x\\):\n\\[ x^{2017} - 2x + 1 = 0 \\]\n\\[ x^{2017} - 2x + 1 = 0 \\]\n\\[ x^{2017} = 2x - 1 \\]\n\nConsider the sum of powers of \\(x\\):\n\\[ S = x^{2016} + x^{2015} + \\dots + x + 1 \\]\n\nWe will use the geometric series property to rewrite \\( S \\):\n\\[ S = \\frac{x^{2017} - 1}{x - 1} \\]\n\nGiven \\( x^{2017} - 2x + 1 = 0 \\), we can rewrite it as:\n\\[ x^{2017} = 2x - 1 \\]\n\nSubstituting \\( x^{2017} \\):\n\\[ S = \\frac{2x - 1 - 1}{x - 1} \\]\n\\[ S = \\frac{2x - 2}{x - 1} \\]\n\\[ S = \\frac{2(x - 1)}{x - 1} \\]\n\\[ S = 2 \\]\n\nThus, the value of \\( S \\) is:\n\\[ \\boxed{2} \\]",
